Package: wdsmatch
Type: Package
Title: Weighted Double Score Matching for Survey-Weighted Causal Inference
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yukang", "Zeng", email = "ykzeng2019@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0000-0000-0000")),
    person("Fan", "Li", email = "fan.f.li@yale.edu", role = "aut"),
    person("Guanglei", "Hong", role = "aut"))
Description: Implements weighted double score matching (WDSM) for estimating
    causal effects from survey-weighted observational data. Matches units on
    both propensity scores and prognostic scores incorporating survey design
    weights, with polynomial sieve bias correction and linearization-based
    multinomial bootstrap variance estimation. Supports estimation of the
    population average treatment effect (PATE) and population average
    treatment effect on the treated (PATT) under retrospective and
    prospective sampling designs.
